glm extended (LikeR.xs)
\&\- family => \*(Aqpoisson\*(Aq (log link) and family => \*(Aqnegbin\*(Aq — negative\-binomial θ estimated by ML via a MASS::glm.nb\-style outer loop, or fixed with theta =>. Matched R to ~1e\-8 (coefs, deviance, null\-dev, AIC, SE, θ); exact Poisson limit when data aren\*(Aqt over\-dispersed.
\&\- Every non\-gaussian family now returns exp (odds/rate/incidence\-rate ratios + conf.low/conf.high), link\-scale conf.int, conf.level, and theta (negbin). Count families report z\-statistics. OR/CI matched R\*(Aqs confint.default exactly.
